  "summary_en": "Peru's national AI strategy for 2026-2030, issued by PCM/SGTD. It sets a vision, four axes (talent, innovation, ethical and regulatory framework, citizen participation), institutional roles such as AI Officers, adoption of ISO/IEC 42001 in public entities, and a roadmap with monitoring. It focuses on public-sector AI, with no robotics content.",
  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
   "Four strategic axes: talent, innovation/entrepreneurship, ethical and regulatory framework, citizen participation",
